</div><div class="relative grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-surface-1/45 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 lg:self-start" style="box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(240,208,96,0.08)"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold-bright/50 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Glowing Wand, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">Magic Power</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+330</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="Divine Glaive"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">Magic Penetration</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+40%</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="Ice Queen Wand"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">Spell Vamp</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+10%</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="Enchanted Talisman, Ice Queen Wand, Glowing Wand"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">HP</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+900</span></p></div></div></div><div class="relative mt-4 overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-gradient-to-br from-surface-3/75 to-surface-2/85 px-4 py-3.5"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold/40 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="mb-2.5 flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right-left h-3.5 w-3.5 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m16 3 4 4-4 4"></path><path d="M20 7H4"></path><path d="m8 21-4-4 4-4"></path><path d="M4 17h16"></path></svg><p class="font-heading text-[10.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-text-accent">Situational Swaps</p></div><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/clock-of-destiny">Clock of Destiny</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/ice-queen-wand">Ice Queen Wand</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Your team already has enough slows and needs you to scale harder into objective fights. Clock adds durability and mana without giving up the poke plan.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/genius-wand">Genius Wand</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/wishing-lantern">Wishing Lantern</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Enemy frontliners are buying magic defense earlier than health. Genius Wand softens targets before Divine Glaive becomes the main damage multiplier.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/blood-wings">Blood Wings</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/wishing-lantern">Wishing Lantern</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Enemy poke reaches you before fights start. Blood Wings turns repeated pre-fight chip into a shield trade instead of a forced recall.</span></li></ul></div></div></article><article id="build-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="build-tab-3" hidden="" class="group/build relative overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/22 bg-surface-2/92 scroll-mt-24" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04) inset, 0 30px 60px -36px rgba(0,0,0,0.95);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.06] hex-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold-bright/80 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-b from-mlbb-gold-bright/70 via-mlbb-gold/30 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover/build:opacity-90" aria-hidden="true" style="background-color:#2ECC711f"></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-4 top-2 font-heading text-[140px] font-black leading-none text-text-accent-bright/[0.04] sm:-right-2 sm:top-0 sm:text-[180px]" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div class="relative p-4 sm:p-5"><header class="mb-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-start sm:justify-between"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-[0.04em] text-mlbb-text sm:text-2xl">Roam Vision</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-2xl text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary sm:text-sm xl:max-w-none">Roam Novaria is a vision and tempo pick, not a primary damage source. Encourage feeds the carries she scouts for, where the revamped Dire Hit would spend its Force on every Astral Meteor poke, and Support Emblem shortens Flicker and Winter Crown windows.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold-bright/35 bg-gradient-to-br from-mlbb-gold-bright/12 to-mlbb-gold-bright/2 px-3 py-1.5"><span class="font-heading text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-accent/85">Cost</span><span class="font-heading text-[13px] font-bold tracking-wide text-text-accent-bright">10,790<!-- -->g</span></div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-blue/35 bg-gradient-to-br from-mlbb-blue/14 to-mlbb-blue/3 px-3 py-1.5 font-heading text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-mlbb-blue-light transition-all duration-200 hover:border-mlbb-blue-light/60 hover:bg-mlbb-blue/20 hover:text-[#9fdcff]" href="/build-simulator?hero=novaria&amp;items=rapid-boots%2Cenchanted-talisman%2Cice-queen-wand%2Cglowing-wand%2Cdivine-glaive%2Cwinter-crown&amp;blessing=encourage&amp;spell=flicker&amp;emblem=support&amp;talents=agility%2Cpull-yourself-together%2Cfocusing-mark&amp;flex=magic-boots.rapid-boots%2Cblood-wings.winter-crown%2Cdire-hit.encourage%2Csky-piercer.winter-crown">Simulator<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link h-3 w-3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 1