:\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Novaria in Mobile Legends: Roam Vision\",\"description\":\"Roam Novaria is a vision and tempo pick, not a primary damage source. Encourage feeds the carries she scouts for, where the revamped Dire Hit would spend its Force on every Astral Meteor poke, and Support Emblem shortens Flicker and Winter Crown windows.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Rapid Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Flicker Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Rapid Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Rapid Boots (750 gold) as item 1 in the Roam Vision build for Novaria.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/novaria#build-roam-vision\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Enchanted Talisman\",\"text\":\"Purchase Enchanted Talisman (2,070 gold) as item 2 in the Roam Vision build for Novaria.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/novaria#build-roam-vision\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Ice Queen Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Ice Queen Wand (2,040 gold) as item 3 in the Roam Vision build for Novaria.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/novaria#build-roam-vision\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Glowing Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Glowing Wand (2,050 gold) as item 4 in the Roam Vision build for Novaria.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/novaria#build-roam-vision\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Divine Glaive\",\"text\":\"Purchase Divine Glaive (1,970 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Vision build for Novaria.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/novaria#build-roam-vision\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Winter Crown\",\"text\":\"Purchase Winter Crown (1,910 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Vision build for Novaria.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/novaria#build-roam-vision\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/novaria\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-19T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":119,\"name\":\"Novaria\",\"slug\":\"novaria\",\"title\":\"Star Rebel\",\"role\":[\"Mage\"],\"specialty\":[\"Burst\",\"Poke\"],\"lane\":[\"Mid\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":3,\"releaseYear\":2023,\"stats\":{\"durability\":30,\"offense\":90,\"controlEffect\":30,\"difficulty\":70},\"winRate\":49.79,\"pickRate\":1.25,\"banRate\":3.94,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"eudora\",\"heroName\":\"Eudora\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Novaria counters Mages with shorter range and low mobility, such as Eudora and Odette, because these heroes can't reach Novaria while Novaria can hit them with her 2nd Skill.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"odette\",\"heroName\":\"Odette\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Novaria counters Mages with shorter range and low mobility, such as Eudora and Odette, because these heroes can't reach Novaria while Novaria can hit them with her 2nd Skill.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"saber\",\"heroName\":\"Saber\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Novaria is countered by Assassins with strong targeted burst damage, such as Saber and Hayabusa, because they can easily close in on Novaria and burst her down.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"hayabusa\",\"heroName\":\"Hayabusa\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Novaria is countered by Assassins with strong targeted burst damage, such as Saber and Hayabusa, because they can easily close in on Novaria and burst her down.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_b2599c8a6c681afdee9a06a92190a58d.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_57eeea6d5bd8d21229de8df79751db9f.png\",\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Star Trail\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Astral Sphere continuously slows nearby enemies by 20% and reveals their position.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Sphere\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" continuously slows nearby enemies by 20% and reveals their position.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5ccfda460fb3ed4b4d044247fbe72ff0.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Astral Meteor\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Novaria summons an Astral Sphere at the target location, dealing 75 (+25% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage every 0.33s and continuously slowing enemies (up to 2.5 times). After 2s, the Astral Sphere explodes, dealing 260 (+50% Total Magic Power) (+ 4% target's Max HP) Magic Damage and slowing enemies by 2.5 times.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Novaria summons an \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Sphere\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" at the target location, dealing 75\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+25% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage every 0.33s and continuously slowing enemies (up to 2.5 times). After 2s, the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Sphere\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" explodes, dealing 260\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 4% target's Max HP) Magic Damage and slowing enemies by 2.5 times.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"8s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_276900dd1748403fba313aa10476e8f0.png\",\"tags\":[\"Slow\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Astral Recall\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"First Cast: Novaria summons an Astral Sphere at a distance and draws it toward her. She gains 80% Movement Speed (decays to 30%) and can pass through obstacles.\\n\\nUse Again: Upon catching the Astral Sphere, she can cast Star Shatter to launch it in the target direction within 5s. Upon hitting an enemy hero, it deals 260 (+95% Total Magic Power) (+ 5% target's Max HP) Magic Damage to them and nearby heroes. The damage will increase based on the Astral Sphere's travel distance (draw + launch), up to 2.2 times the original damage.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"First Cast\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Novaria summons an \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Sphere\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" at a distance and draws it toward her. She gains 80% Movement Speed (decays to 30%) and can pass through obstacles.\\n\\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Use Again\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Upon catching the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Sphere\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", she can cast \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Star Shatter\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to launch it in the target direction within 5s. Upon hitting an enemy hero, it deals 260\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+95% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 5% target's Max HP) Magic Damage to them and nearby heroes. The damage will increase based on the \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Sphere\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"'s travel distance (draw + launch), up to 2.2 times the original damage.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"20s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18a74de4a5f949bac5b6d3a6d8a9180b.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Astral Echo\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Novaria scatters Astral Echo in the target direction, briefly slowing enemy heroes hit by 50% and applying Astral Ring on them. This increases their hitbox by 2.5 times and reveals their position for 5s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Novaria scatters \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Echo\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" in the target direction, briefly slowing enemy heroes hit by 50% and applying \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Astral Ring\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" on them. This increases their hitbox by 2.5 times and reveals their position for 5s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"48s\",\"manaCost\":\"100\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_76e8b6d3cb047f2b5f1a3d21469b40f6.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1-0-1/1\"},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"beatrix\",\"heroName\":\"Beatrix\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Novaria works well with other long-range heroes like Beatrix and Layla because her Ultimate makes any target a sitting duck for her team to pick off.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Novaria works well with other long-range heroes like Beatrix and Layla because her Ultimate makes any target a sitting duck for her team to pick off.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Novaria's Ultimate to gain vision of the battlefield, then summon an Astral Sphere with her 2nd Skill. After catching the Astral Sphere, launch it to damage the enemy and use her 1st Skill to thwart enemy heroes that try to get close.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11930,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_76e8b6d3cb047f2b5f1a3d21469b40f6.png\"},{\"skillId\":11920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18a74de4a5f949bac5b6d3a6d8a9180b.png\"},{\"skillId\":11920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18a74de4a5f949bac5b6d3a6d8a9180b.png\"},{\"skillId\":11910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_276900dd1748403fba313aa10476e8f0.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, initiate by using Novaria's 2nd Skill to gain extra Movement Speed and summon an Astral Sphere. Then, slow the enemy with her 1st Skill and use her 2nd Skill again to launch the Astral Sphere to deal damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":11920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18a74de4a5f949bac5b6d3a6d8a9180b.png\"},{\"skillId\":11910,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_276900dd1748403fba313aa10476e8f0.png\"},{\"skillId\":11920,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18a74de4a5f949bac5b6d3a6d8a9180b.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Novaria build, counter, and MLBB strategy guide for patch 2.1.95. Clock of Destiny power spike, Astral Ring combos, and when to pick this poke mage.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Novaria is not a burst mage. She is a siege weapon: slow to aim, devastating when the setup lands, and completely unplayable when the enemy refuses to stand still. She punishes slow, tanky teams from ranges most mages cannot reach, but she depends on specific conditions in the draft and in the fight to function at all.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"novaria\",\"patch\":\"2.1.95\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-18\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"mid-standard\",\"name\":\"Mid Lane Standard\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"arcane-boots\",\"name\":\"Arcane Boots\",\"cost\":690,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"clock-of-destiny\",\"name\":\"Clock of Destiny\",\"cost\":2030,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"lightning-truncheon\",\"name\":\"Lightning Truncheon\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\",\"cost\":2000,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"clock-of-destiny\",\"name\":\"Clock of Destiny\"},{\"slug\":\"lightning-truncheon\",\"name\":\"Lightning Truncheon\"},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"bargain-hunter\",\"name\":\"Bargain Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/bargain-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"impure-rage\",\"name\":\"Impure Rage\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/impure-rage.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flameshot\",\"name\":\"Flameshot\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"holy-crystal\",\"name\":\"Holy Crystal\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when your frontline is protecting you and the enemy backline is reachable through Astral Echo. Raw Magic Power is stronger than the shield in clean poke games.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"trigger\":\"Enemy has a committed backline diver such as Ling, Fanny, Hayabusa, Natalia, or Gusion. Frozen buys the one window Novaria needs to reset through a wall.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},\"trigger\":\"Enemy sustain is keeping frontliners alive through poke. Lifebane matters more than early Magic Defense shred against healer or regen-heavy drafts.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default protected-mid setup. Clock of Destiny and Lightning Truncheon create the first real poke spike, then penetration keeps Star Shatter relevant once enemies buy magic defense.\",\"totalCost\":11040,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":345,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Lightning Truncheon\",\"Genius Wand\",\"Divine Glaive\",\"Blood Wings\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\",\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":400,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\"]},{\"key\":\"mp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.mana\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":800,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Lightning Truncheon\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Arcane Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Genius Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":20,\"sources\":[\"Clock of Destiny\",\"Lightning Truncheon\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=novaria\u0026items=arcane-boots%2Cclock-of-destiny%2Clightning-truncheon%2Cgenius-wand%2Cdivine-glaive%2Cblood-wings\u0026spell=flameshot\u0026emblem=mage\u0026talents=rupture%2Cbargain-hunter%2Cimpure-rage\u0026flex=holy-crystal.blood-wings%2Cwinter-crown.blood-wings%2Cglowing-wand.genius-wand\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"mid-frontline-control\",\"name\":\"Frontline Control\",\"roleContext\":\"Mid\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"cost\":2040,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\",\"cost\":2250,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"mage\",\"name\":\"Mage Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"bargain-hunter\",\"name\":\"Bargain Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/bargain-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"impure-rage\",\"name\":\"Impure Rage\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/impure-rage.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flameshot\",\"name\":\"Flameshot\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"clock-of-destiny\",\"name\":\"Clock of Destiny\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},\"trigger\":\"Your team already has enough slows and needs you to scale harder into objective fights. Clock adds durability and mana without giving up the poke plan.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"genius-wand\",\"name\":\"Genius Wand\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\"},\"trigger\":\"Enemy frontliners are buying magic defense earlier than health. Genius Wand softens targets before Divine Glaive becomes the main damage multiplier.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"wishing-lantern\",\"name\":\"Wishing Lantern\"},\"trigger\":\"Enemy poke reaches you before fights start. Blood Wings turns repeated pre-fight chip into a shield trade instead of a forced recall.\"}],\"notes\":\"Use this into tanky or sustain-heavy drafts where Novaria's job is repeated scouting, slows, and HP pressure rather than a single burst pick.\",\"totalCost\":11090,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":330,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"Glowing Wand\",\"Wishing Lantern\",\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Ice Queen Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":900,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"Glowing Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"mp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.mana\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":400,\"sources\":[\"Wishing Lantern\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Magic Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":12,\"sources\":[\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"Glowing Wand\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":35,\"sources\":[\"Magic Boots\",\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Wishing Lantern\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=novaria\u0026items=magic-boots%2Cenchanted-talisman%2Cice-queen-wand%2Cglowing-wand%2Cwishing-lantern%2Cdivine-glaive\u0026spell=flameshot\u0026emblem=mage\u0026talents=agility%2Cbargain-hunter%2Cimpure-rage\u0026flex=clock-of-destiny.ice-queen-wand%2Cgenius-wand.wishing-lantern%2Cblood-wings.wishing-lantern\"},{\"slot\":3,\"id\":\"roam-vision\",\"name\":\"Roam Vision\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"rapid-boots\",\"name\":\"Rapid Boots\",\"cost\":750,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"cost\":2070,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"cost\":2040,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\",\"cost\":2050,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"divine-glaive\",\"name\":\"Divine Glaive\",\"cost\":1970,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\",\"cost\":1910,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"enchanted-talisman\",\"name\":\"Enchanted Talisman\"},{\"slug\":\"ice-queen-wand\",\"name\":\"Ice Queen Wand\"},{\"slug\":\"glowing-wand\",\"name\":\"Glowing Wand\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"support\",\"name\":\"Support Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"agility\",\"name\":\"Agility\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/agility.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"pull-yourself-together\",\"name\":\"Pull Yourself Together\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/pull-yourself-together.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"focusing-mark\",\"name\":\"Focusing Mark\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/focusing-mark.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"encourage\",\"name\":\"Encourage\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"rapid-boots\",\"name\":\"Rapid Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Enemy keeps forcing combat before you can rotate. Magic Boots keeps scouting and Astral Echo uptime steadier than the extra 15 Movement Speed.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blood-wings\",\"name\":\"Blood Wings\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"trigger\":\"Enemy lacks hard backline dive but chips you with long-range magic or marksman poke. The shield has more uptime than Frozen in slow sieges.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"dire-hit\",\"name\":\"Dire Hit\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"encourage\",\"name\":\"Encourage\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when Novaria plays alone on the flank all game, so the aura reaches nobody and the Force movement speed is worth more than the ally stats.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sky-piercer\",\"name\":\"Sky Piercer\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"winter-crown\",\"name\":\"Winter Crown\"},\"trigger\":\"Only buy when your team is already snowballing and you are finishing revealed low-HP targets without dying. Drop it if stacks stay low or dives reach you.\"}],\"notes\":\"Roam Novaria is a vision and tempo pick, not a primary damage source. Encourage feeds the carries she scouts for, where the revamped Dire Hit would spend its Force on every Astral Meteor poke, and Support Emblem shortens Flicker and Winter Crown windows.\",\"totalCost\":10790,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"magicpower\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPower\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":255,\"sources\":[\"Enchanted Talisman\",\"Ice Queen Wand\",\"Glowing Wand\",\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"adaptiveatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.adaptiveAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":45,\"sources\":[\"Winter Crown\"]},{\"key\":\"magicpen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicPenetration\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Divine Glaive\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"comm