"Novaria\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"48.87\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid1\",\"params\":{\"name\":\"Novaria\",\"delta\":\"-0.96%\"}}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"1.25\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceMid2\"}],[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"className\":\"text-text-primary\",\"children\":[\"1.22\",\"%\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"k\":\"pages.heroes.rankSentenceAfter\",\"params\":{\"rank\":\"Mythical Glory+\"}}]]}]]}]\naa:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}]\nab:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Firing S2 at close range.\"}],\" The sphere's damage scales hard with how far it travels from where it was summoned. Summoning it directly beside yourself and immediately launching generates a fraction of the maximum hit. The correct sequence is: summon the sphere far away, wait for it to draw toward you, then aim at the target from behind terrain or at range. Players who fire the moment the sphere appears are essentially playing without S2 damage.\"]}]\nac:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Initiating against Helcurt.\"}],\" Helcurt's ultimate silences nearby enemies. Triggering it with S2 as the sphere draws toward you locks out your follow-up S1 and any movement commands for the duration. Against Helcurt, do not initiate the trade. Play through S1 zone denial only, hold S2 for escape, and let his team come to you rather than pressing into his silence window.\"]}]\nad:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Using Astral Ring on a single sidelane target.\"}],\" The ult costs mana at every level and sits on a long cooldown. Spending it to secure one sidelane kill before a major objective fight burns the tool that could have changed the teamfight outcome. Reserve it for grouped enemies unless the single target is the enemy carry who will otherwise reach a decisive item before the next contest.\"]}]\nae:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Ignoring the movement burst on S2.\"}],\" Novaria gains a burst of movement speed the moment S2's sphere is summoned, and it is her only real repositioning tool. Players who panic-run in open space during a dive are not using it. Before every fight, know the path that takes you out of the enemy's reach; burning the burst in the wrong direction is how Novaria players die having survived the hardest part of the fight.\"]}]\naf:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#E8E6E3] font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Continuing to fight after burning both escapes.\"}],\" Once S2 is on cooldown and Flameshot is spent, Novaria has no repositioning tools. Most deaths happen in this window. If both are on cooldown, retreat to a position where terrain protects you and wait for at least S2 to return before committing to another trade.\"]}]\nb0:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Key tips\"]}]\nb1:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-0\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"The Astral Ring hitbox enlargement persists through dashes and blinks. An enemy who flashes away immediately after being hit by the ult still carries the enlarged hitbox. Do not assume the dash negated the effect.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb2:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-1\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Genius Wand reaches its maximum magic defense reduction stack before S1's explosion if the enemy stands in the sphere's tick-damage zone until it goes off. This means the explosion itself hits a target who is already at reduced magic resistance, which makes standing inside the sphere and tanking the tick the most costly play the enemy can make.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb3:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-2\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(200,170,110,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(200,170,110,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-lightbulb w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1gvzjb\",{\"d\":\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"x1upvd\",{\"d\":\"M9 18h6\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"ceow96\",{\"d\":\"M10 22h4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#C8AA6E\"},\"children\":\"Tip\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Pre-summon S2 before a teamfight rather than during it. The sphere holds at your position before it can be launched, so you enter a lord or turtle contest with a fully charged shot already waiting rather than spending the opening of the fight summoning it.\"]}]]]}]]}]\nb4:[\"$\",\"div\",\"blockquote-3\",{\"className\":\"my-5 p-4 flex gap-3\",\"style\":{\"background\":\"rgba(0,170,255,0.08)\",\"border\":\"1px solid rgba(0,170,255,0.35)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-info w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"circle\",\"1mglay\",{\"cx\":\"12\",\"cy\":\"12\",\"r\":\"10\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1dtifu\",{\"d\":\"M12 16v-4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"e9boi3\",{\"d\":\"M12 8h.01\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"min-w-0 flex-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[11px] font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\",\"style\":{\"color\":\"#00AAFF\"},\"children\":\"Note\"}],[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Flameshot knocks back nearby enemies on cast and deals increased damage at maximum range. It is a defensive spell as much as an offensive one. When a melee assassin closes in after S2 is on cooldown, Flameshot in their face buys the distance needed to survive until S2 returns. Most players treat it purely as bonus damage and miss the peel value entirely.\"]}]]]}]]}]\n"])</script></body></html>